<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><i>Proposal 4 &#8211;&#160;</i>The issuance of
20% or more of the Company&#8217;s outstanding shares of Common Stock upon exercise of the common stock purchase warrants, issued to certain
holders (&#8220;Holders&#8221;) of the Company&#8217;s Series B Convertible Preferred Stock purchase warrants issued on October 17, 2023,
for purposes of Rule 5635(d) of The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (&#8220;Nasdaq&#8221;), was approved by the Company&#8217;s stockholders at
the Special Meeting. The final voting results were as follows:</p>

