<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><i>Proposal 6 &#8211;&#160;</i>The amendment to
the Company&#8217;s 2018 Long-Term Stock Incentive Plan (the &#8220;LTIP&#8221;) to increase the annual share limit of Common Stock that
may be issued only for the 2024 fiscal year under the LTIP from 8% of the shares of Common Stock outstanding to 15% of the shares of Common
Stock outstanding, was approved by the Company&#8217;s stockholders at the Special Meeting. The final voting results were as follows:</p>

